# Store text as LF in the repository, check out native on each platform.
# Matters here because CI runs the suite on both windows-latest and ubuntu-latest.
* text=auto

# `git archive` builds the source tarball for a release, and that tarball is one of
# the files SHA256SUMS lists. Shipping the checksum file inside an archive it
# describes cannot be made consistent -- writing the hash changes the tarball.
# The authoritative copy is the release asset.
release/SHA256SUMS export-ignore
